1
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:19,600
You have twenty minutes and one thing that has to get done.

2
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:27,400
Seat 14C turns that into a flight.

3
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:34,600
Check in with up to three tasks, then board.

4
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:44,600
Rest your hands and the tray meets them.

5
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:54,600
Your first flight teaches the three gestures: pinch, grab and twist.

6
00:00:55,600 --> 00:01:06,600
Pick one task, set the length, take off.

7
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:19,600
The cabin lights dim and everything but your task steps back.

8
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:29,600
Glance at the card for its steps.

9
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:44,600
A stray thought? Flick it into the jar. It waits for you after landing.

10
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:54,600
Turn your palm up to pause, or to land early.

11
00:01:55,600 --> 00:02:05,600
The chime means landing. Drop the card on Done, take a breath,

12
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:19,600
and watch the route grow. Every new place leaves a postcard.

13
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:28,600
Every action works by hand, by look and pinch, or by looking alone.

14
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:36,600
And a three-day streak earns a night cabin.

15
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:44,500
Seat 14C. Finish one thing before you land.

